# Normalise text to LF in the repository, so line endings never differ between
# platforms or between the working tree and what a host (GitHub Pages) serves.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep the vendored, hash-pinned libraries byte-for-byte. piexif.js carries a
# Subresource Integrity hash in index.html; CRLF conversion changed its bytes
# and broke that hash on GitHub Pages, so the browser refused to run it and
# every Randomize/Strip failed. Treating vendor/ as binary prevents any
# conversion, so the served bytes match the hash.
vendor/** -text

# Images are binary.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
